{
  "id": "treatment-bias",
  "term": "treatment bias",
  "definition": "Treatment bias is prejudice or skewed judgment in care that can arise from treatment providers’ attitudes and beliefs about clients. In this context, it refers especially to stigmatising views about people who use drugs that can interfere with supportive treatment relationships.",
